@journey name=hl-stage-c1a2-part2 title="Half-Life c1a2 stage, part 2: from the part 1 card, the ceiling panel, the corridor crabs, the crate stack, the ladder, the ledge above it, the hatch and the duct, ending hidden behind the broken vent cover with an @save" prologue=load card_fixture=tests/cards/c1a2-part1.mcd card_sha256=773f16fa888822b9094ef6a4d223afab9268386f5fc307be410f40ea19b4c941 sync=poll max_ticks=40000
# Part 2 of c1a2 (card tests/cards/c1a2-part1.mcd). The panel *2 breaks under the crouched player (pressure) or the crowbar; three ceiling crabs wake
# at x ~475 (shoot them from the south side, the crate *4 blocks the line from y -790); the big crate *4 is pushed west, the small crate *29 east, the stack is
# climbed with two running jumps; ladder *93 is climbed holding forward (view level) to its top (up -317, head against the ceiling); JUMP OFF it (held jump
# = the retail dismount, lands on the ledge (146,-832,-340) in both the retail oracle and here); the ledge leads to a dead-end corridor, whose floor hatch *89
# (ENT 74) breaks to a crouched swing straight down; the duct below runs west to the vent cover *88 (ENT 73); the player ends behind it at x -65, hidden from the
# security gun (the gun sees the opening for x < -90: do not cross the trigger *86 there at low health).
map c1a2 next x
  @wait expr="i32(LOGIC_PLAYER_POS[2]) != 0" timeout=120
  30
  3 flash
  @hold duck f60 until x>=620 timeout=40
  15 duck
  @weapon crowbar
  @aim at=640,-444,-860 timeout=80
  10 duck
  @swing ent=1 duck=true timeout=40
  @level
  @weapon glock dir=next
  @checkpoint dropped
  @probe
  @assert sym=LOGIC_PLAYER_HEALTH size=2 op=between value=0 value_hi=100
  60
  @face 3070 right
  @checkpoint turned
  @probe
  @assert sym=LOGIC_PLAYER_HEALTH size=2 op=between value=0 value_hi=100
  @hold s-127 until y<=-880 timeout=40
  @fight near=300 kind=2 below=100 above=40 aimup=6 for=40 sleep=9 reload=11 reloadquiet=200
